From 3c6683181d91bac2a907f5c7f5ef81a7d95924d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 23:56:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] upscalers: Preserve OptiScaler INI comments.

Update only the requested options during nightly setup and environment
overrides. Preserve comments, key spelling, unrelated settings and line
endings instead of serializing the complete file with ConfigParser.

Cover stable and nightly setup, formatting preservation and rejected
ambiguous edits with regression tests.
---
 optiscaler_nightly.py    | 82 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 tests/test_optiscaler.py | 54 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 upscalers.py             | 13 ++++---
 3 files changed, 129 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/optiscaler_nightly.py b/optiscaler_nightly.py
